# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values. Never commit `.env.local`.

# No model key: since 2026-09-23 no sentence on the site is generated by a
# language model (owner ruling BA-10; src/app/no-model-text.test.ts).

# No payment keys: there is no paid tier (CLAUDE.md, D4 amendment), and the
# checkout endpoint and payments adapter were removed on 2026-09-24.

# §26 voice A/B kill-switch. Unset/0 = dormant (everyone gets the classic voice);
# "1" = run the transparent 50/50 online-voice experiment. Smoke-test the live
# voice first, THEN flip this to 1; flip back to 0 to stop it without a rollback.
NEXT_PUBLIC_VOICE_AB=

# Public base URL used on share and OG image URLs (no trailing slash).
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Support/contact email shown on /legal (optional — without it, /legal points
# readers at the address on the repository).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPORT_EMAIL=
